      <shape width="66.94629921259842" height="50.8" topLeftX="33.25511811023622" topLeftY="15.769133858267715" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="36" fontFamily="锐字真言体免费商用" strikethrough="false" underline="false">01</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="560" height="36.25" topLeftX="110.86724409448817" topLeftY="33.10251968503937" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">串口发送：怎么把数字发出去？</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="124" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">① 发送就是一句调用</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">HAL_UART_Transmit 把一段字节发出去，长度和超时要自己写清楚，发完才返回。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="194" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">② 数字要先变成字符</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">串口只能发字节，直接发一个 int 会得到乱码。用 sprintf 拼成字符串再发。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="264" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">③ 换行别忘</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">字符串结尾加上回车换行，串口助手才一行一行显示，看着才清楚。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="378" height="230" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="112" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(240, 240, 240, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <border color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" width="1" lineJoin="miter" miterLimit="10"/>
      </shape>
      <shape width="354" height="212" topLeftX="522" topLeftY="120" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Consolas" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="no-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">char buf[32];</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(140, 70, 190, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">sprintf(buf, "duty=%d\r\n", duty);</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(140, 70, 190, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">HAL_UART_Transmit(&amp;huart1,</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(140, 70, 190, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">    (uint8_t *)buf, strlen(buf), 100);</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(86, 86, 86, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">// 长度用 strlen，别写死</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(86, 86, 86, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">// 超时 100ms，够用了</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="817.58" height="34" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="372" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <content verticalAlign="middle" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="14" paddingRight="14" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">发送是主动的、阻塞的：先转成字符，再写清长度，最后记得换行。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note>
      <content>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">发送比接收简单得多。HAL_UART_Transmit 的四个参数分别是串口对象、数据地址、字节数、超时时间，数据必须先转成 uint8_t 指针。这里有一个高频错误：直接把一个整数变量的地址传进去、长度写 4，串口助手上就会出现四个奇怪的字符，因为那四个字节是二进制而不是文字。要发数字，先用 sprintf 转成字符串。长度也可以用 strlen 自动算。另外别忘了字符串末尾的\r\n，它是串口助手的换行符，不加的话所有输出会连成一行。</span></p>
      </content>
    </note>
